-05-12 11:37:17','',0,'http://www.cellernou.com/?p=101',0,'post','',0),(117,1,'2011-05-12 12:30:37','2011-05-12 11:30:37','Des del dia 5 de Maig, hem instal·lat al celler l\'exposició \"sensacions en relleu\" de l\'artista Judith Martínez. Durant la inauguració, vàrem acompanyarem a l\'artista convidant-vos a un tast de cava de Ventura Soler.\r\n\r\nUs animem que vingueu a visitar-la.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.cellernou.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/retol.jpg\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-102\" title=\"retol\" src=\"http://www.cellernou.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/retol.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"2050\" /></a>','Nova exposició \"sensacions en relleu\" de Judith Martínez. Inauguració amb cava el 5 de Maig al celler.','','inherit','open','open','','101-revision-8','','','2011-05-12 12:30:37','2011-05-12 11:30:37','',101,'http://www.cellernou.com/?p=117',0,'revision','',0),(173,1,'2012-01-07 19:48:55','2012-01-07 18:48:55','Des del 7 de gener, us oferim el <strong>Cava Brut Nature Reserva R.J.MUR a 9,95 €.</strong>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.cellernou.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/01/R.J.MUR_.jpg\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-171\" title=\"R.J.MUR\" src=\"http://www.cellernou.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/01/R.J.MUR_-224x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"224\" height=\"300\" /></a>','Cava Reserva Brut Nature R.J.Mur','','inherit','open','open','','170-autosave','','','2012-01-07 19:48:55','2012-01-07 18:48:55','',170,'http://www.cellernou.com/?p=173',0,'revision','',0),(174,1,'2012-01-07 19:48:26','2012-01-07 18:48:26','Des del 7 de gener, us oferim el <strong>Cava Brut Nature<span style=\"line-height: 24px;\"> </span><span style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Reserva </span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><strong>Oriol Rossell a 7,99 €</strong>.</span>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.cellernou.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/01/Oriol-Rossell.jpg\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-175\" title=\"Oriol Rossell\" src=\"ht